2026-07-03 00:56:28,346 | INFO | Company Object: {'competitor': 'MyFitnessPal', 'source': 'trustpilot', 'review_url': 'https://www.trustpilot.com/review/www.myfitnesspal.com', 'review_count': 15, 'reviews': [{'text': 'Good way to track calories intake', 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': 'Good app to help you recognize how you are eating', 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': 'Love this app been using it for years, I hate the new design layout, I liked the macros in a pie chart only thing that is better is where u can look back at the dates of your logs much easier,please please change it back to what it used to be like but just leaving the way you can change the date \U0001f64f', 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': 'Quite a good and easy app to help with tracking your food intake', 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': 'Excellent in measuring calories. Guiding you in your fast loss journey.', 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': 'It has a very good database of foods and experiences, feels smooth, other than the ads thing.', 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': 'Great app but please stop playing with the design! Even for someone who�s used it for years the new updates are so confusing and complex. The old design was much more simple and user friendly', 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': "It's a wonderful tool to help me stay on track.", 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': 'The app is very easy to use and contains just about every food item known to man. I used to use Noom, and they do not begin to compare with MyFitnessPal.', 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': 'I needed help reconnecting an app (Map My Walk) to My Fitness Pal. Koya emailed me with specific detailed steps, which did not correct the error, but subsequently followed up with another fix which actually worked. Great customer service.', 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': "I love using MyFitnesspal to track what I eat and how many calories I'm consuming. I am down 50lbs just by tracking what I eat! This little app has helped me a lot.", 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': 'It�s a good free app. I�ve been using it since 2012', 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': "It's free, easy to use, no trial periods and then they start charging. Just a few ads pop up, nothing over the top. The calories are accurate, you can save meals and create recipes, adding ingredients in bulk. A great easy way to track nutrients and calories. Whatever your goal is, track calories or protein, this is the one!", 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': 'Love the app really helps with my weight-loss goal.', 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': 'I love this App, it gives me everything I need except, Sodium Content up with the Fats, Carbs & Calories.\nI never needed to know my Sodium numbers until a month ago when, I started to have issues with my heart & having to go on blood thinners. Now, not only do i need the calories, carbs & fats; I need the sodium contents of the foods as well.', 'source': 'trustpilot'}]}
