2026-07-03 10:10:28,593 | INFO | Company Object: {'competitor': 'MyFitnessPal', 'source': 'trustpilot', 'review_url': 'https://www.trustpilot.com/review/www.myfitnesspal.com', 'review_count': 15, 'reviews': [{'text': "I haven't been on the app for months. I'm back on it and I am delighted with all the new updates they made. Much easier to use and gives you a lot of information right at your fingerstips.", 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': 'I love this app! I have been using it for years, since when almost all features were free, although I understand changes happen to keep the app active. If you in doubt, just download it, YOURE NOT GOINT TO REGRET IT!', 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': 'Application generally is fine except for when a start a walk and it will not allow me to store my results.', 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': 'This app is very helpful with helping me stay on track with calorie counting and weight loss. Any food I have looked up so far has been easy to find and that makes it more doable and helps me from wanting to give up', 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': 'I love being able to track my food and see how I am reaching my goals each day. It�s very easy to use and I love the convenience of using it to log my food.', 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': "An excellent app to use to count calories and assess exactly what you're eating everyday.", 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': "You get a good idea of how many calories you are consuming. I just don't like having to pay a lot for barcode reading from packages", 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': 'Good way to track calories intake', 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': 'Good app to help you recognize how you are eating', 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': 'Love this app been using it for years, I hate the new design layout, I liked the macros in a pie chart only thing that is better is where u can look back at the dates of your logs much easier,please please change it back to what it used to be like but just leaving the way you can change the date \U0001f64f', 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': 'Quite a good and easy app to help with tracking your food intake', 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': 'Excellent in measuring calories. Guiding you in your fast loss journey.', 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': 'It has a very good database of foods and experiences, feels smooth, other than the ads thing.', 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': 'Great app but please stop playing with the design! Even for someone who�s used it for years the new updates are so confusing and complex. The old design was much more simple and user friendly', 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': "It's a wonderful tool to help me stay on track.", 'source': 'trustpilot'}]}
