2026-07-04 20:31:41,971 | INFO | Company Object: {'competitor': 'Sworkit', 'source': 'trustpilot', 'review_url': 'https://www.trustpilot.com/review/sworkit.com', 'review_count': 2, 'reviews': [{'text': 'I thought the website was good but when it came to cancel my membership it was an absolute nightmare. The only way to cancel is through a chatbot on their site which no one ever responds to. I reached out to their support email and also got no response. I am ready to take legal action against them to get my money back. Horrible customer service. I do not recommend them at all.', 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': 'Excellent fitness & wellness app with lots of great features.', 'source': 'trustpilot'}]}
