2026-07-05 02:33:56,272 | INFO | Company Object: {'competitor': 'MyFitnessPal', 'source': 'trustpilot', 'review_url': 'https://www.trustpilot.com/review/www.myfitnesspal.com', 'review_count': 15, 'reviews': [{'text': 'Easy to keep a check on your cholesterol.', 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': "The app is very easy to use, it's well laid out and simple to navigate", 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': 'Easy to use. Handy for tracking calories', 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': 'Been using it since 2012,its the best food tracker out there \U0001f44c', 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': 'Love this app so easy to log information.', 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': 'helpful to track food paid or not', 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': 'I havnt been on for a while,but when im counting calories I use fitness pal\nIt has everything on it that I need,quick to look up items,', 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': 'I Love it! I can edit what food I want.', 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': 'I find the app very useful. Improvements are made regularly.\nI find that the layouts are designed so you hit the premium button (by mistake) which is frustrating and annoying.\nUpgrades should be separate. I have used premium and prefer the standard version.', 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': 'I like the previous version better.', 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': 'App is horribly glitchy. Have had to uninstall and reinstall 3 times in the past 24 hours and it still is not working. Ive been a My Fitness Pal user for years now. This latest update is horrible', 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': "Love this site I do try to add up my calories every day and this makes it so easy for me!! Keeps me on track. But they did an update not too long again not too sure about it little bit harder to monitor or maybe I'm just getting used to it..", 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': 'A great way to plan, track and monitor food intake and nutrients thereof as well as water intake.\nProvides various meal plans to help reach your goal!\nFitness Pal pairs easily with other tech devices such as Renpho scale, Apple phone/watch to monitor your caloric intake, body fat etc\nDefinitely a great app at a very reasonable cost!!!', 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': 'I�ve found some of the items have the wrong calories and can�t find one to match.', 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': "Easy to use and understand. Great database of foods, though some stats are not accurate when I check against the manufacturer's information. An abundance of resources on topics related to weight loss/management and wellness, as well as fitness. Feeback on logs is helpful.", 'source': 'trustpilot'}]}
