2026-07-05 02:34:42,114 | INFO | Company Object: {'competitor': 'Strong', 'source': 'trustpilot', 'review_url': 'https://www.trustpilot.com/review/strongerlabel.com', 'review_count': 15, 'reviews': [{'text': 'I ordered flared pants but received a completely different pair than I ordered. I contacted stronger through their website by filling out the form and received a reply the next day eventhough the automated reply told me it was very busy and could take op to 4 days. They offered to send me the original pants that I ordered and told me I could keep the other pants too. Fabulous service I must say! Thanks again!!', 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': 'Between February 2025 and July 2025, I purchased several STRONGER items (3 pairs of long leggings, 4 sports bras, and 2 pairs of shorts). Overall, I am very satisfied with these products, which are often admired by people I meet at the gym. They come in either classic colors (black, blue, etc.) or more unique patterns. All fit well and stay in place during movement.\nUnfortunately, my black leggings, purchased in July 2025, showed signs of abnormal wear after 8 months of use. In fact, the small white dotted lines on the thigh (Stronger�s signature design) are fading and deteriorating abnormally. This surprises me all the more because I own the same model in blue, purchased in March 2025, which did not show any damage despite identical use.\nI therefore filed a complaint, which was processed the same day and resolved positively, as Stronger immediately offered to send me an identical replacement for the damaged item.\nSTRONGER is therefore a brand with beautiful, high-quality products that is also reliable, given that their customer service provides a quick and appropriate solution in the event of a problem. I therefore recommend this brand if you�re looking for stylish athletic wear.', 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': "The 15% discount for new members was not applied. My order was around 200 euro, so it was not pleasant.\nI decided to return one of the items that was not a good fit, and it turned out that returns are not free. I don't remember anything like this, definitely not with clothing - this is so weird that there are zero free options to return, all are paid! I will not order again.\n2 stars for quality, the items were good quality, but customer experience was not to be repeated.", 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': "Sportswear that lasts for years! I have so many things from them, some newer and some that have already served me for years. Super comfy and stylish designs, and the quality really doesn't disappoint.", 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': "Love it! Great support. Accidentally ordered the wrong color of the tights and got the help I needed when I contacted Support. Can't wait to try them on. Thank you so much!", 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': 'Very fast response and they resolved my �issue� it was not an issue really just a question and they did everything to make\nme happy!', 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': 'Never received my order because they just decided to send it to a different cuty, to a pick up point. No one informed me, no one said delivery was not successful, no one said it will not be delivered to my home addrss after I explicitly said I wanted it delivered to my home.Honestley, I am never buying your stuff again. Many other brands will make the effort of delivering to my home. If you csnot be bothered, so be it.', 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': 'Great service - friendly', 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': 'My order never arrived, but I was fully refunded.', 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': 'Im very pleased with Stronger customer service. They helped me a lot even though they didnt have to ! appreciate that !', 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': 'The quality of the clothes and the service is really good. I had to exchange one of my items and it was a really easy process.\n\nWould definitely recommend.', 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': 'The quality was really good and delivery fast. Even due to size matter we wanted to send back it was easy, even though they charged for returning the order.', 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': 'Great fit and quality.', 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': 'I got very quick reply and my problem was solved in a few hours after I contacted customer service!\nThank you Stronger customer support:)', 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': 'I bought some clothing from stronger. I put in my correct delivery details but the parcel was sent to the incorrect address by UPS. By the time I found this out the 3 weeks time frame had passed and they�d no longer help me with it, so I have paid a small fortune for a parcel that never turned up. Customer service was terrible - they really don�t care amount their customers at all.', 'source': 'trustpilot'}]}
