2026-07-05 18:41:29,822 | INFO | Company Object: {'competitor': 'MyFitnessPal', 'source': 'trustpilot', 'review_url': 'https://www.trustpilot.com/review/www.myfitnesspal.com', 'review_count': 15, 'reviews': [{'text': "I like the new interface and that days logged in a row isn't automatically reverted to zero based on one missed day of logging. It's a small detail that doesn't seem important but losing a streak could be demoralizing for some.", 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': "Well I been using your program off and one for years. I want to do a cle,an slate, aka delete my old foods I eat in the past. It's to hard to delete every single item", 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': 'I dislike the constant up or changes. They do nothing but make things hard to find', 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': "It's free, what's not to like.", 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': 'Despite having a pay for premium feature, the free version is fantastic. I cannot tell you how much I respect My Fitness Pal for that. Great app!!', 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': 'Great app easy to use with clear interface', 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': 'This app would sync up with Map My Fitness but no more. That�s unfortunate', 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': 'I like that all the food I add is listed. However feel it�s very expensive for the paid version.', 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': 'Makes me more mindful of my food intake', 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': 'Easy to keep a check on your cholesterol.', 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': "The app is very easy to use, it's well laid out and simple to navigate", 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': 'Easy to use. Handy for tracking calories', 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': 'Been using it since 2012,its the best food tracker out there \U0001f44c', 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': 'Love this app so easy to log information.', 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': 'helpful to track food paid or not', 'source': 'trustpilot'}]}
