2026-07-05 19:02:32,238 | INFO | Company Object: {'competitor': 'Shred', 'source': 'trustpilot', 'review_url': 'https://www.trustpilot.com/review/vshred.com', 'review_count': 15, 'reviews': [{'text': 'I have not received a welcome or thank you email however my payment has been processed. Is this a legitimate site?', 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': 'Back on Dec. 15 20025 I contacted customer service via their chat feature. I was to know how to cancel my subscription. This feature as you can imagine isn\'t readily apparent. Its burried. Well the customer service person or bot provided guidence, and as I had recently iterated through the app i was confident I could effectivly cancel. ... Skip forwar to 6 months later. I notice Im still being charged. Bad on my part to not have seen their charge sooner. Anyhow, I go back to the chat feature and say, hey I thought I canceled my subscription and they, reply somthing to the effect of "your now canceled. expect no more charges. I say wait a minute, i though i canceled a while back. to which they say basicaly we told you how, and you didnt do it. I asked for a 6 month refund, they said sorry, how about 3 months. Apparently their integrity, is only worth $30, after I\'ve paid many more month of service and purchased there less than effective supplements.', 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': 'I ordered the $57 vshred for women. Somehow the Burn supplements showed up, I clicked on something everything disappeared.\nI checked email I was charged. I try to sign in app every number sent doesn�t work.\nI don�t hear back from anyone for help or support.\nI sent an email requesting to be refunded for everything.\nI�m disappointed how this company runs.\nI want my full refund.', 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': 'Although I haven�t really given it a go as I only just purchased it a few days ago, I have sent several emails to ask questions but hear nothing but and only get the upselling emails in return.\nI have decided I�d like my money back as I have too many health issues to even try to continue. I haven�t heard anything back and reading some reviews I�m a little scared I won�t get my money back.', 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': 'What a �classless� organization. �wait there�s more�, Wait, there�s more�, Wait there�s more.\nI would have given them a higher rating but the �up-selling was such a waste of my time and I haven�t even used the product.\nThe only reason I decided to give it a try is there has been the same person hawking the product for so long that if he has been there so long they must be doing something right. I was surprised they had such a low approval rating. I do this all the time . With me it�s always a knee jerk reaction and I get taken every time. I hope, at least, it might work. My credit card company takes the money first and ask questions later.\nOh, by the way, VIC is getting a little flabby where the pecks meet the shoulders. Not a good look.\nButterroll', 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': 'I looked into this as it claims to be for any man. But, some of us are outside any of the options. I have a prosthetic leg, and missing part of the other door, am diabetic and very peculiar with foods I eat. None of their "alternative adjustments" as advertised would address any of my concerns. So, after reading many of the reviews I decided to pass. This is why they only give you 10 minutes to purchase the deal... By selling many the so called refund is irrelevant. Just think about how much interest you could make on that money over the 60 day cycles, and, remember, it\'s not money made on just your purchase, but all of them ADDED TOGETHER! Id do something like that for you guys.... Just send me some cash and I\'ll give you something, then in 60 days I\'ll refund your original amount..... Get it? Use your brain, don\'t get scammed, if this was truly so great it would be blowing up everywhere, not a million in 100 countries, but a million in each major city. So.... Trillions of people doing it. Just my thoughts....', 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': 'I emailed for help and I got a response back in minutes. No questions asked and I was refunded as requested.\n\nExcellent service', 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': "DON'T DO IT!! If you think your buying a one-time purchase item...YOU'RE NOT! You get billed each month. When you try to cancel...YOU CAN'T. There is nowhere to cancel in your profile. You are then directed to call them to speak with a team member where everything is automated so you don't speak with a human. If I could rate this program a ZERO I would. SAVE YOUR MONEY $$", 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': "Absoulte scam! I signed up as it sounded promising. A majority of the members area is promoting selling more products. It's no different from any other diet program. Eat healthy and exercise. I'm trying to cancel my subscription, it's not easy to navigate. Ive sent emails and surprise surprise no emails. Looks like a blocked payment through the bank it is then!", 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': "To make this short , I didnt even start the program all the way, was told I would recieve a refund for supplements I had already bought if I did the complete program I went ahead and did the program, I never received the refund for the products I bought so I started making phone calls after going round and round with a person that told me they didn't know anything about that, he finally gave me a refund for the supplements I bought! I was so upset at this point I told him to go ahead and cancel the whole program I didn't even want to do it and I would pay for my supplements because yes I did order them he said no he would give me a refund for them and check into everything that I told him. after that I did get a message saying yes there was such a program of what he told me there wasn't. Then you have to contact somebody else to get a refund for the program that you signed up for but nobody tells you that you only have so many hours to get a full refund I didn't even start the program and I was charged over $700 out of the $1997 cost. I subtracted the cost of my supplements out of that $700 that they still owed me which means as far as I'm concerned they owe me $389 still which I feel is the Fair Deal I have contacted the Better Business Bureau and so far it's just been messages back and forth with the company of them refusing to refund me the rest of my money. Part of the problem in this company is that the right hand doesn't know what the left hand is doing they have different offices for different things so you have to go round and round with people on different subjects and get sent to another office which takes a lot of time and effort.", 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': 'I was really excited this program, but did not realize it was mostly online/email reminders and only using an app. I was hoping for direct contact like it was explained to me and it was very impersonal for the huge price I paid. So disappointing.', 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': 'In reading some other reviews, yes agreed, much of what they offer can be found free on the internet. HOWEVER, the coach I was paired with personalized EVERYTHING specifically to my needs, ie: cooking needs for my household, physical issues like knee pain, arthritis, etc. The plan was very personalized!! He kept in touch with me at least weekly but when I reached out to him, even when he was on vacation, I never went longer than 12 hours without hearing from him! The coaching was very positive and re-enforcing. But my BIGGEST and most gratifying comment was that they were NOT pushy!!! In fact, the first coach I was put in touch with spent a 45 minute session online with me yet when I chose NOT to put the money they were requesting (I am very, very skeptical of online scams!!!), he did not pressure me and just said, I�m here if you change your mind!! And then, upon taking what I considered a big risk, I contacted V-Shred back and was contacted by another coach. I explained my trepidation and reasonings behind it - Matt assured me we would work together for a 3 month trial period, AT A DISCOUNT �.. I was provided with ALL the information I was guaranteed, never charged a penny more than agreed to, NEVER pressured for more purchases AND �. Here we go : when the 3 month period was over and I reached out, coach Matt and I agreed that I had learned soooo much from him and was well on my way with my lessons - and that was it!!! Not even ONCE was there an inquiry of going further or more money being put out!!!! Now �.. thanks to Matt always bringing it to my attention, I PIT IN THR WORK, and that�s where I�ve been successful! But I wouldn�t be in this positive position without his help and guidance, always bringing there for me! Thank you Matt!!! Plus, when I asked if I could stay in touch to share my continued success (which I KNOW will follow!!), coach Matt and his sales Rep were very receptive to that too! They want to hear about my continued success!!!! HIGHLY RECOMMENDED if you are serious!!!!', 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': 'I have barely began this so called "program". I\'m not sure for WHAT I\'m paying? Very, very little is free. Once you pay the initial fee, you might have access to a few workouts and daily calorie suggestions. To take complete advantage of the program, you must pay for more programs. Supplemental recommendations are frequent, are at a high cost, and not necessarily needed or beneficial. My initial consultation with a so called "expert" was another push for product and further coaching, all at extra costs. This Vince guy makes constant videos most of which are redundant and lengthy. I would like a refund but doubt I will be granted one. In essence I\'ve paid for nothing. This is a complete waste of money. Buyer beware.', 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': 'I�m extremely unhappy with their customer service. I joined them last year in August 2025. I paid over 4 k to be in the program and 3 months later I was diagnosed with early stage ovarian cancer. I asked them to put a pause on my plan due to the fact I had many things to take care of like treatments and surgery. When I got back I couldn�t log in to my account. I tried everything and to this day I still can�t log in. I contacted them via email and all they said was to change my password. I did that and it didn�t work. It kept saying that my account was frozen. I�m really upset because I paid for a whole year program and used it for just 3 months. I�m not asking for a full refund , but just a partial refund and they keep ignoring me. Not sure what to do anymore.', 'source': 'trustpilot'}, {'text': 'Well they said they would fast forward this to their higher ups. Nope. So like I said before, save your money these people are scammers and they have absolutely no interest in you at all.', 'source': 'trustpilot'}]}
